<p>Focus energies into a beam to lash all creatures in a line with physical force, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">146, 196, 236, 269, 298</acronym> Physical damage and knocking them off balance (-15% damage penalty) for 2 turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Mindpower.</p>